                    "One phone call and I used it to order a pizza.",
                    "I didn't do it. But I'd do it again. The pizza, I mean.",
                    "Cell's got no WiFi. THIS is the real punishment.",
                    "I'm basically a prisoner of my own bad choices. Relatable?",
